flowchart TD
  accTitle: Choose the missing capability before adding instructions
  accDescr: Unclear outcomes need a brief; missing actions need tools; reusable knowledge may justify a skill; repeated event actions may justify hooks.
  A{"What is missing?"}
  A -->|Clear outcome| B["Improve the brief or acceptance list"]
  A -->|Ability to act| C["Use an existing tool or connect an API"]
  C --> D{"Agent needs a shared tool interface?"}
  D -->|Yes| E["Consider an MCP connection"]
  D -->|No| F["Use the CLI or API directly"]
  A -->|Recurring knowledge| G["Check available skills and docs"]
  G --> H{"A useful procedure is still absent?"}
  H -->|Yes| I["Try one narrow custom skill"]
  H -->|No| J["Reuse the existing guidance"]
  A -->|Repeated event action| K["Consider a narrowly scoped hook"]
